    narr:Narrative_ZypherionAnalyticsAdoption
      narr:theme "Replacing Zypherion with Meridian as the analytics database due to streaming ingestion gaps" ;
      skos:note "The organisation is replacing Zypherion with Meridian for its analytics pipeline. Zypherion was found to have critical gaps in streaming ingestion; Meridian handles both batch and streaming natively. The Q3 2026 migration window is retained. This supersedes the original Zypherion adoption decision." ;
      dct:source narr:Sample_MeridianDecision_20260406 .
